  m_Name: PancitCantonHistory
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - text: Carrying both Hokkien and Cantonese linguistic layers shaped by urban panciterias
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - text: and complemented by the 1989 introduction of the popular instant noodle
      variant
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - text: this birthday staple honors the age-old wish for long life.
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - text: ' Can you toss it all together in a hot wok without breaking a single noodle?'
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
